le=\"Mountain View, California\">Mountain View, California</a>. The museum presents stories and artifacts of <a href=\"/wiki/Silicon_Valley\" title=\"Silicon Valley\">Silicon Valley</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Information_Age\" title=\"Information Age\">Information Age</a>, and explores the <a href=\"/wiki/Digital_Revolution\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Digital Revolution\">computing revolution</a> and its impact on society.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐77f8cc8f9b‐xcwhk\nCached time: 20260918180947\nCache expiry: 1057816\nCache expiry source: Template:Years_or_months_ago (currentmonth)\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.218 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.324 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1048/1000000\nRevision size: 1352/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 16766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3637/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 3/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3907/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.128/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 2649001/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 1/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  294.182      1 -total\n 51.01%  150.054      1 Template:Infobox_museum\n 46.52%  136.865      1 Template:Infobox\n 31.52%   92.731      1 Template:Short_description\n 19.18%   56.428      2 Template:Pagetype\n 14.07%   41.379      1 Template:Coord\n  9.85%   28.988      7 Template:Main_other\n  8.99%   26.447      1 Template:For\n  7.04%   20.724      1 Template:SDcat\n  6.58%   19.362      1 Template:Use_mdy_dates\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID 21db281b-b38c-11f1-99de-93f4f8a9f9f7 -->\n</div>",
